{
  "name": "SocialPro - Progreso y avisos 70-80-100",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "hourly-trigger",
      "name": "Cada hora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-860, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "crm-base-url",
              "name": "crmBaseUrl",
              "value": "https://socialpro.es",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "config",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-640, 0],
      "notes": "Único sitio donde cambiar el entorno del CRM. compose.yaml fija N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=true, así que $env no está disponible desde los nodos."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.crmBaseUrl }}/api/automation/deals/sync",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sync-deals",
      "name": "Sincronizar tratos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-400, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "ESTE WORKFLOW ES EL ÚNICO DUEÑO DEL SYNC. No añadir /deals/sync a ningún otro. Los avisos se mantienen pendientes hasta que el nodo Confirmar aviso ejecuta el ACK tras publicar en Discord."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-alerts",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.alerts.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-alerts",
      "name": "Hay avisos nuevos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-160, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "alerts",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "split-alerts",
      "name": "Separar avisos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "alert-message",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ ($json.level === 100 ? '✅ ' + $json.name + ' ha completado su deal (100%).' : '⚠️ ' + $json.name + ' ha alcanzado el ' + $json.level + '% de su deal.') + ' · ' + $('Config').first().json.crmBaseUrl + '/admin/campanas/' + $json.campaignId }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-alert",
      "name": "Preparar mensaje",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [320, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "guildId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1522153792592806018",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1533123515023360114",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "content": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-discord-alert",
      "name": "Publicar aviso en Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [560, -80],
      "notes": "Asignar la credencial Discord Bot account al importar. El ACK solo se ejecuta si Discord confirma el envío."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.crmBaseUrl + '/api/automation/deals/' + $('Preparar mensaje').item.json.campaignId + '/alerts/ack' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ level: $('Preparar mensaje').item.json.level }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "acknowledge-alert",
      "name": "Confirmar aviso en CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [800, -80],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "notes": "Asignar la credencial SocialPro CRM - Production al importar. El watermark avanza después de publicar en Discord, nunca antes."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.crmBaseUrl }}/api/automation/deals/invoices",
      "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
      "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
      "sendBody": true,
      "specifyBody": "json",
      "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ excludedCampaignIds: [48, 19, 17] }) }}",
      "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "create-invoice-drafts",
      "name": "Crear borradores al 80%",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-160, 220],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
    "notes": "Crea únicamente borradores idempotentes. Nunca emite ni envía una factura. UXU × YOSPORTS, TODOCS2 × SKINSMONKEY y FER × SKINSMONKEY quedan excluidos por decisión operativa."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "discordMessages",
        "options": {
          "destinationFieldName": "content"
        }
      },
      "id": "split-invoice-messages",
      "name": "Separar avisos de factura",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "guildId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1522153792592806018",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1533123515023360114",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "content": "={{ $json.content }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-invoice-draft",
      "name": "Publicar borrador en Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [320, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.crmBaseUrl }}/api/automation/deals/reminders",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "process-tracking-reminders",
      "name": "Revisar inactividad 7 días",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-160, 420],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "reminders",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "split-tracking-reminders",
      "name": "Separar recordatorios",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "guildId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1522153792592806018",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1533123515023360114",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "content": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-tracking-reminder",
      "name": "Publicar recordatorio en Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [320, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.crmBaseUrl + '/api/automation/deals/reminders/' + $('Separar recordatorios').item.json.campaignId + '/ack' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ baselineAt: $('Separar recordatorios').item.json.baselineAt }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ack-tracking-reminder",
      "name": "Confirmar recordatorio en CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [560, 420],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
